---
import ManagementLayout from '../layouts/ManagementLayout.astro';
---
<ManagementLayout title="승적증명서 발급·대장" active="monasticCertificates" showCurrentUser={false}>
  <div class="page-heading"><div><p class="page-heading__kicker">MONASTIC REGISTRATION CERTIFICATE</p><h1>승적증명서 발급·대장</h1><p>승적원부의 재적 사실을 확인하여 대외발급용 승적증명서를 발급하고 발급대장을 관리합니다.</p></div></div>
  <section class="surface certificate-issue-panel">
    <div class="section-title"><div><h2>승적증명서 발급</h2><p>승적원부에 재적으로 등재되어 확인된 대상자만 발급 가능합니다. 발급 시점의 내용은 별도 보존됩니다.</p></div><span class="privacy-note">대외발급본은 법명·성명(속명)·승적 확인사항만 포함하며 생년월일·개인 연락처·수계 상세는 제외합니다.</span></div>
    <form data-issue-form>
      <div class="form-grid certificate-form-grid">
        <div class="form-field--full certificate-person-pick">
          <div class="form-field"><label for="monastic-person">승적원부 대상자 선택 *</label><select id="monastic-person" name="registryId" data-registry-select required><option value="">불러오는 중입니다.</option></select></div>
          <div class="form-field"><label for="monastic-registry-search">대상자 검색 (성명·법명·소속 사찰)</label>
            <div class="certificate-registry-search"><input id="monastic-registry-search" type="search" maxlength="100" autocomplete="off" data-registry-query placeholder="이름·법명·사찰·승적번호" aria-label="승적원부 대상자 검색" /><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-registry-search>검색</button></div>
            <small class="field-hint" data-registry-search-result aria-live="polite">재적 승려를 선택하거나 오른쪽에서 검색하세요.</small>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-field"><label for="monastic-name">법명</label><input id="monastic-name" data-person-name readonly /></div>
        <div class="form-field"><label>성명(속명)</label><input data-person-layname readonly /></div>
        <div class="form-field"><label for="monastic-no">승적번호</label><input id="monastic-no" data-person-number readonly /></div>
        <div class="form-field"><label for="monastic-temple">소속 사찰</label><input id="monastic-temple" data-person-temple readonly /></div>
        <div class="form-field"><label for="monastic-verified">확인 기준일</label><input id="monastic-verified" data-person-verified readonly /></div>
        <div class="form-field"><label for="monastic-issue-date">발급일 *</label>
          <div class="employment-smart-date" data-smart-date-control><input id="monastic-issue-date" name="issueDate" type="text" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="10" placeholder="YYYY-MM-DD" autocomplete="off" required />
            <button type="button" class="employment-smart-date-picker-shell" data-open-date-picker title="달력에서 발급일 선택" aria-label="달력에서 발급일 선택">▦</button>
            <input type="date" class="employment-smart-date-native" data-date-picker tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" data-no-weekday />
            <span class="employment-smart-date-weekday" data-date-weekday hidden></span></div></div>
        <div class="form-field form-field--full"><label for="monastic-purpose">제출 용도 *</label><input id="monastic-purpose" name="purpose" maxlength="300" placeholder="예: 소속 종단 승적 확인용" required /></div>
        <div class="form-field"><label for="monastic-signatory-title">발급명의 직함 *</label><select id="monastic-signatory-title" name="signatoryTitle" required><option value="이사장">이사장</option><option value="이사장 직무대리">이사장 직무대리</option></select></div>
        <div class="form-field"><label for="monastic-signatory-user">발급명의 성명 *</label><select id="monastic-signatory-user" name="signatoryUserId" data-signatory-select required><option value="">계정 목록을 불러오는 중입니다.</option></select></div>
        <div class="form-field"><label for="monastic-manager">담당자</label><input id="monastic-manager" name="managerName" maxlength="60" /></div>
        <div class="form-field"><label for="monastic-contact">연락처</label><input id="monastic-contact" name="contact" maxlength="80" /></div>
        <div class="form-field form-field--full employment-logo-option"><span class="field-label">좌측 상단 종단 로고</span><label class="certificate-logo-check"><input type="checkbox" name="includeLogoSqSeal" /><span>종단 로고 표시</span></label><small class="field-hint">재직증명서와 같은 종단 로고를 A4 문서 왼쪽 상단에 표시합니다. 직인 겹침 위치는 별도로 유지합니다.</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="status-message" data-issue-status aria-live="polite"></div>
      <div class="form-actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-preview>입력내용 미리보기</button><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" data-issue-button>승적증명서 발급</button></div>
    </form>
  </section>
  <section class="surface certificate-ledger">
    <div class="section-title"><div><h2>승적증명서 발급대장</h2><p>발급번호, 발급일, 법명, 승적번호, 발급명의와 취소 여부를 확인합니다.</p></div>
      <div class="toolbar ledger-filters"><select data-ledger-status><option value="">전체 상태</option><option value="발급">발급</option><option value="취소">취소</option></select>
        <input type="search" data-ledger-query placeholder="발급번호·법명·승적번호·용도 검색" />
        <select data-ledger-size><option>10</option><option selected>20</option><option>50</option></select>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-ledger-search>조회</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-ledger-export>CSV</button></div></div>
    <div class="status-message" data-ledger-message aria-live="polite"></div>
    <div class="data-wrap"><table class="data-table certificate-table"><thead><tr><th>발급번호</th><th>발급일</th><th>법명</th><th>승적번호</th><th>소속 사찰</th><th>용도</th><th>발급명의</th><th>상태</th><th>관리</th></tr></thead><tbody data-ledger-body><tr><td colspan="9">불러오는 중입니다.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    <div class="pagination" data-ledger-pagination></div>
  </section>
  <div class="modal-overlay" data-preview-modal hidden><section class="modal certificate-preview-modal"><header class="modal__header"><h2>승적증명서 미리보기 · 테스트용 (미발급)</h2><button type="button" class="modal__close" data-close-preview aria-label="닫기">×</button></header><div class="modal__body"><div data-preview-container></div><div class="modal__actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-close-preview>닫기</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-print-preview>인쇄</button></div></div></section></div>
  <script is:inline>
    (async () => {
      const $=(s,r=document)=>r.querySelector(s),$$=(s,r=document)=>Array.from(r.querySelectorAll(s));
      const esc=v=>String(v??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
      const session=await window.MilgyoSession.ready();if(!session?.token)return;
      const api=async(url,p)=>{const r=await window.MilgyoSession.fetch(url,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(p)});const d=await r.json();if(!d.ok&&r.status===401&&window.MilgyoSession.isAuthFailure(d))throw new Error(d.message);return d};
      const today=()=>new Date(Date.now()+9*3600000).toISOString().slice(0,10);
      const status=(selector,message,kind='')=>{const el=$(selector);el.textContent=message||'';el.className=`status-message ${kind}`};
      const weekdayLabel=value=>{const m=/^(\d{4})-(\d{2})-(\d{2})$/.exec(value||'');if(!m)return '';const d=new Date(Date.UTC(+m[1],+m[2]-1,+m[3]));return d.getUTCFullYear()===+m[1]&&d.getUTCMonth()===+m[2]-1&&d.getUTCDate()===+m[3]?`(${['일','월','화','수','목','금','토'][d.getUTCDay()]})`:''};
      const dateInput=$('[name=issueDate]'),nativeDate=$('[data-date-picker]'),weekday=$('[data-date-weekday]');
      const parsedDate=raw=>{const t=String(raw||'').trim();const m=/^(\d{4})[-./]?(\d{2})[-./]?(\d{2})$/.exec(t);if(!m)return '';const v=`${m[1]}-${m[2]}-${m[3]}`;return weekdayLabel(v)?v:''};
      const syncDate=()=>{const date=parsedDate(dateInput.value);weekday.textContent=weekdayLabel(date);weekday.hidden=!date;if(date)nativeDate.value=date;};
      const commitDate=()=>{const d=parsedDate(dateInput.value);if(!d){dateInput.setCustomValidity('YYYYMMDD 또는 YYYY-MM-DD 형식으로 입력해 주세요.');return false;}dateInput.value=d;dateInput.setCustomValidity('');syncDate();return true;};
      dateInput.addEventListener('input',()=>{dateInput.setCustomValidity('');const d=parsedDate(dateInput.value);if(d)dateInput.value=d;syncDate()});dateInput.addEventListener('blur',commitDate);
      $('[data-open-date-picker]').addEventListener('click',()=>{nativeDate.value=parsedDate(dateInput.value)||today();try{nativeDate.showPicker()}catch{nativeDate.focus();nativeDate.click();}});
      nativeDate.addEventListener('change',()=>{if(nativeDate.value){dateInput.value=nativeDate.value;commitDate();dateInput.focus()}});
      dateInput.value=today();syncDate();
      let records=[],signatories=[],organizationUsers=[],rows=[],page=1,pages=1,currentPrint=null,requestId='',registrySearchSeq=0,registrySearchTimer=null;
      const selectedRegistry=()=>records.find(r=>String(r.id)===$('[data-registry-select]').value);
      const selectedOrgUser=()=>organizationUsers.find(u=>String(u.id)===$('[data-signatory-select]').value);
      const fillRegistry=()=>{const r=selectedRegistry();$('[data-person-name]').value=r?.dharma_name_ko||'';$('[data-person-layname]').value=r?.lay_name||'';$('[data-person-number]').value=r?.monastic_no||'';$('[data-person-temple]').value=r?.temple||'';$('[data-person-verified]').value=r?.last_verified_date||'';updateIssuanceState();};
      const updateIssuanceState=()=>{
        const signer=selectedOrgUser();
        const ready=Boolean(selectedRegistry()&&signer);
        $('[data-issue-button]').disabled=!ready;
        $('[data-issue-button]').title=ready?'승적원부와 입력 내용을 기준으로 정식 발급합니다.':'승적원부 대상자와 발급명의 성명을 선택해 주세요.';
      };
      const showRegistryOptions=(items,hasMore=false)=>{
        records=Array.isArray(items)?items:[];
        const select=$('[data-registry-select]');select.innerHTML='<option value="">대상자를 선택해 주세요</option>'+records.map(r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.dharma_name_ko)} · ${esc(r.lay_name||'성명 미기재')} · ${esc(r.monastic_no)} · ${esc(r.temple||'소속 사찰 미지정')}</option>`).join('');
        $('[data-registry-search-result]').textContent=records.length?`검색 결과 ${records.length}건${hasMore?' 이상 · 검색어를 더 구체적으로 입력해 주세요.':''}`:'일치하는 재적 원부가 없습니다. (테스트 미리보기는 가능합니다.)';
        fillRegistry();
      };
      const searchRegistry=async()=>{
        const seq=++registrySearchSeq,query=$('[data-registry-query]').value.trim();
        $('[data-registry-search-result]').textContent='승적원부 검색 중입니다.';
        try{
          const d=await api('/api/monastic-certificates/query',{operation:'search-registry',query});
          if(seq!==registrySearchSeq)return;
          if(!d.ok){status('[data-issue-status]',d.message,'error');return;}
          showRegistryOptions(d.registry,d.hasMoreRegistry);
        }catch(error){if(seq===registrySearchSeq)status('[data-issue-status]',error.message||'승적원부 검색 오류','error');}
      };
      const koreanDate=v=>{const m=/^(\d{4})-(\d{2})-(\d{2})$/.exec(v||'');return m?`${+m[1]}년 ${+m[2]}월 ${+m[3]}일`:v||'-'};
      const signatoryName=v=>{const s=String(v||'');return /^[가-힣]{2,5}$/.test(s)?[...s].join(' '):s};
      const printCss=`
        .monastic-certificate-root,.monastic-certificate-root *{box-sizing:border-box}
        .monastic-certificate-root{background:#dfe4ea;padding:1rem}
        .monastic-certificate-paper{position:relative;width:794px;min-height:1123px;background:white;margin:0 auto;padding:78px 64px 74px;color:#111;font-family:"Nanum Myeongjo","Noto Serif KR","Malgun Myeongjo",Batang,serif}
        .monastic-certificate-top-logo{position:absolute;z-index:1;left:44px;top:34px;width:100px;height:100px;object-fit:contain}
        .monastic-certificate-subhead{text-align:right;font-size:13px;color:#526071;margin:0 0 34px}
        .monastic-certificate-title{text-align:center;font-size:34px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.42em;text-indent:.42em;margin:0 0 8px;white-space:nowrap}
        .monastic-certificate-english{text-align:center;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#657184;margin:0 0 55px}
        .monastic-certificate-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 20px}
        .monastic-certificate-section{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 12px}
        .monastic-certificate-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;font-size:16px}
        .monastic-certificate-table th,.monastic-certificate-table td{border:1.3px solid #88919c;padding:15px 10px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;line-height:1.4;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
        .monastic-certificate-table th{background:#eef2f5;font-weight:600;width:17%}
        .monastic-certificate-table td{width:33%}
        .monastic-certificate-statement{text-align:center;line-height:2.05;font-size:17px;margin:50px 14px 30px;word-break:keep-all}
        .monastic-certificate-statement--notice{text-align:center}
        .monastic-certificate-purpose{font-size:15.5px;margin:18px 0 50px}
        .monastic-certificate-date{text-align:center;font-size:18px;margin:0 0 38px}
        .monastic-certificate-issuer{width:100%;margin:0 auto;padding-bottom:75px;text-align:center;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.7}
        .monastic-certificate-issuer-block{display:inline-grid;justify-items:end;position:relative;margin:0 auto;width:max-content;max-width:100%;text-align:right}
        .monastic-certificate-issuer-line{position:relative;z-index:2;display:block;white-space:nowrap;letter-spacing:0}
        .monastic-certificate-issuer-line + .monastic-certificate-issuer-line{margin-top:4px}
        .monastic-certificate-seal{position:absolute;z-index:1;right:-62px;top:2px;width:98px;height:98px;object-fit:contain;pointer-events:none;opacity:1;mix-blend-mode:normal;filter:none;background:transparent}
        .monastic-certificate-contacts{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;border-top:1px solid #c4cbd4;margin-top:8px;padding-top:16px}
        .monastic-certificate-disclaimer{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;column-gap:.25em;align-items:start;font-size:11px;color:#526073;line-height:1.6;margin-top:10px}
        .monastic-certificate-disclaimer-mark{display:block}
        .monastic-certificate-disclaimer-text{display:block}
        .monastic-certificate-disclaimer-line{display:block}
        .monastic-certificate-invalid{position:absolute;z-index:5;top:45%;left:16%;transform:rotate(-23deg);border:6px solid #9d2828;color:#9d2828;opacity:.58;font-size:72px;font-weight:bold;padding:10px 28px}
        .monastic-certificate-test-watermark{position:absolute;z-index:8;top:15px;left:18px;transform:rotate(-10deg);border:3px double #981e27;border-radius:4px;padding:3px 9px;text-align:center;font-family:"Malgun Gothic",sans-serif;font-size:23px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.1;color:#981e27;background:rgba(255,255,255,.94);pointer-events:none;-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact}
        .monastic-certificate-test-watermark small{display:block;font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap}
        .monastic-certificate-test-watermark--with-logo{left:155px}
        .monastic-certificate-print-action{width:794px;text-align:right;margin:12px auto}
        @page{size:A4;margin:0}@media print{.monastic-certificate-root{padding:0;background:#fff}.monastic-certificate-paper{margin:0}.monastic-certificate-print-action{display:none}}
      `;
      const markup=(s,invalid=false,previewMode=false)=>{const previewNotice=previewMode&&!s.monasticNo;return `<div class="monastic-certificate-root"><article class="monastic-certificate-paper">
        ${s.includeLogo?'<img class="monastic-certificate-top-logo" src="/certificates/logo-sq.png" alt="" />':''}
        ${invalid?'<div class="monastic-certificate-invalid">발급취소</div>':previewMode?`<div class="monastic-certificate-test-watermark${s.includeLogo?' monastic-certificate-test-watermark--with-logo':''}">테스트용<small>미리보기·미발급 · 효력 없음</small></div>`:''}
        <h1 class="monastic-certificate-title">승 적 증 명 서</h1><p class="monastic-certificate-english">CERTIFICATE OF MONASTIC REGISTRATION</p>
        <div class="monastic-certificate-meta"><span>발급번호: ${esc(s.certificateNo||'미리보기')}</span><span>발급일: ${esc(koreanDate(s.issueDate))}</span></div>
        <p class="monastic-certificate-section">승적 확인사항</p>
        <table class="monastic-certificate-table"><tbody>
          <tr><th>법 명</th><td>${esc(s.dharmaName||'-')}</td><th>성 명</th><td>${esc(s.layName||'-')}</td></tr>
          <tr><th>승적번호</th><td>${esc(s.monasticNo||'-')}</td><th>승적 상태</th><td>${esc(s.status||'-')}</td></tr>
          <tr><th>소속 종단</th><td>${esc(s.organization||'대한불교밀교종')}</td><th>소속 사찰</th><td>${esc(s.temple||'-')}</td></tr>
          <tr><th>승적 취득일</th><td>${esc(koreanDate(s.acquiredDate))}</td><th>확인 기준일</th><td>${esc(koreanDate(s.verificationDate))}</td></tr>
        </tbody></table>
        <p class="monastic-certificate-statement${previewNotice?' monastic-certificate-statement--notice':''}">${previewNotice?'본 화면은 서식 확인을 위한 테스트 출력물로서 승적 등재 여부를 증명하지 않습니다.':'위 사람은 발급일 현재 본 종단의 승적원부에 재적 승려로 등재되어 있음을 확인하여 이에 증명합니다.'}</p>
        <p class="monastic-certificate-purpose">제출 용도 : ${esc(s.purpose||'-')}</p>
        <p class="monastic-certificate-date">${esc(koreanDate(s.issueDate))}</p>
        <div class="monastic-certificate-issuer"><div class="monastic-certificate-issuer-block"><div class="monastic-certificate-issuer-line">대한불교밀교종</div><div class="monastic-certificate-issuer-line">${esc(s.signatoryTitle||'이사장')} ${esc(signatoryName(s.signatoryName||'-'))}${previewMode?' (미발급)':''}</div>${previewMode?'':'<img class="monastic-certificate-seal" src="/organization-seal.png" alt="대한불교밀교종 직인" />'}</div></div>
        <div class="monastic-certificate-contacts">연락처 : ${esc(s.contact||'-')}<div>문서 진위 확인 : 발급번호·발급일자·발급권자를 발급기관에 조회</div></div>
        <div class="monastic-certificate-disclaimer"><span class="monastic-certificate-disclaimer-mark">※</span><span class="monastic-certificate-disclaimer-text"><span class="monastic-certificate-disclaimer-line">본 증명서는 본 종단의 승적 등재 사실에 관한 자체 확인서로서, 타 종단 승적이나 국가 자격을 증명하지 않습니다. 수계·법계·소임은</span><span class="monastic-certificate-disclaimer-line">필요한 경우 별도 확인합니다.</span></span></div>
      </article></div>`;};
      // 테스트 미리보기는 필수 발급조건과 독립적이며, D1 발급대장에 기록하지 않습니다.
      const snapshotFromForm=()=>{const f=new FormData($('[data-issue-form]')),r=selectedRegistry(),s=selectedOrgUser();return {certificateNo:'테스트용 · 미발급',dharmaName:r?.dharma_name_ko||'테스트 법명',layName:r?.lay_name||'테스트 성명',monasticNo:r?.monastic_no||'',status:r?'재적':'미확인',organization:'대한불교밀교종',temple:r?.temple||'테스트 사찰',acquiredDate:r?.acquired_date||'',verificationDate:r?.last_verified_date||'',issueDate:parsedDate(f.get('issueDate'))||today(),purpose:f.get('purpose')||'서식 확인용',signatoryTitle:f.get('signatoryTitle')||'이사장',signatoryName:s?.name||'발급명의 미선택',includeLogo:f.get('includeLogoSqSeal')==='on',managerName:f.get('managerName'),contact:f.get('contact')};};
      const parseSnapshot=row=>{try{return JSON.parse(String(row.certificate_snapshot||'{}'))}catch{return {}}};
      const preview=s=>{currentPrint={snapshot:s,invalid:false,previewMode:true};$('[data-preview-container]').innerHTML=`<style>${printCss}</style>${markup(s,false,true)}`;$('[data-preview-modal]').hidden=false;};
      const printRecord=(row)=>{const s=row.snapshot||parseSnapshot(row),invalid=row.invalid||row.status==='취소';if(!s.certificateNo){alert('인쇄 정보가 없습니다.');return;}const w=window.open('','_blank','width=980,height=1080');if(!w){alert('팝업 차단을 해제해 주세요.');return;}w.document.write(`<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>${esc(s.certificateNo)} 승적증명서</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#fff}${printCss}</style></head><body>${markup(s,invalid,Boolean(row.previewMode))}<div class="monastic-certificate-print-action"><button onclick="window.print()">인쇄</button></div></body></html>`);w.document.close();};
      $$('[data-close-preview]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{$('[data-preview-modal]').hidden=true}));
      $('[data-preview]').addEventListener('click',()=>{preview(snapshotFromForm())});
      $('[data-print-preview]').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(currentPrint)printRecord(currentPrint)});
      $('[data-registry-select]').addEventListener('change',fillRegistry);
      $('[data-signatory-select]').addEventListener('change',updateIssuanceState);
      $('[name=signatoryTitle]').addEventListener('change',updateIssuanceState);
      $('[data-registry-search]').addEventListener('click',()=>{clearTimeout(registrySearchTimer);searchRegistry()});
      $('[data-registry-query]').addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Enter'){e.preventDefault();clearTimeout(registrySearchTimer);searchRegistry();}});
      $('[data-registry-query]').addEventListener('input',()=>{registrySearchSeq++;clearTimeout(registrySearchTimer);registrySearchTimer=setTimeout(searchRegistry,350)});
      const loadOptions=async()=>{
        const d=await api('/api/monastic-certificates/query',{operation:'options'});
        if(!d.ok){status('[data-issue-status]',d.message,'error');$('[data-preview]').hidden=true;$('[data-issue-button]').hidden=true;return;}
        signatories=d.signatories||[];organizationUsers=d.organizationUsers||[];
        showRegistryOptions(d.registry,d.hasMoreRegistry);
        const toOpts=items=>items.map(u=>`<option value="${esc(u.id)}">${esc(u.name)} · ${esc(u.position||u.grade||'직위 미지정')}</option>`).join('');
        $('[data-signatory-select]').innerHTML=organizationUsers.length?toOpts(organizationUsers):'<option value="">선택 가능한 계정이 없습니다.</option>';
        const preferred=organizationUsers.find(u=>['이사장','이사장 직무대리'].includes(String(u.position||'').trim()))||organizationUsers.find(u=>String(u.id)===String(session.user.id))||organizationUsers[0];
        if(preferred){$('[data-signatory-select]').value=String(preferred.id);if(['이사장','이사장 직무대리'].includes(String(preferred.position||'').trim()))$('[name=signatoryTitle]').value=String(preferred.position).trim();}
        updateIssuanceState();
        $('[name=managerName]').value=session.user.name||'';loadLedger();
      };
      const newRequest=()=>{requestId=crypto.randomUUID()};newRequest();
      $('[data-issue-form]').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{
        e.preventDefault();if(!commitDate()||!e.currentTarget.reportValidity())return;
        const r=selectedRegistry();if(!r){status('[data-issue-status]','승적원부를 선택해 주세요.','error');return;}
        const chosen=selectedOrgUser();if(!chosen){status('[data-issue-status]','발급명의 성명을 선택해 주세요.','error');return;}
        const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget),btn=$('[data-issue-button]');btn.disabled=true;status('[data-issue-status]','발급대장에 저장하는 중입니다...');
        try{const d=await api('/api/monastic-certificates/action',{operation:'issue',requestId,registryId:f.get('registryId'),issueDate:f.get('issueDate'),purpose:f.get('purpose'),signatoryTitle:f.get('signatoryTitle'),signatoryUserId:f.get('signatoryUserId'),managerName:f.get('managerName'),contact:f.get('contact'),includeLogoSqSeal:f.get('includeLogoSqSeal')==='on'});
          if(!d.ok){status('[data-issue-status]',d.message,'error');return;}status('[data-issue-status]',d.message,'ok');if(d.row)printRecord(d.row);newRequest();page=1;await loadLedger();
        }catch(err){status('[data-issue-status]',err.message||'발급 오류','error');}finally{btn.disabled=false;}
      });
      const loadLedger=async()=>{const d=await api('/api/monastic-certificates/query',{operation:'list',query:$('[data-ledger-query]').value.trim(),status:$('[data-ledger-status]').value,page,pageSize:Number($('[data-ledger-size]').value)});
        if(!d.ok){status('[data-ledger-message]',d.message,'error');return;}rows=d.rows||[];pages=d.pages||1;
        status('[data-ledger-message]',`총 ${Number(d.total||0).toLocaleString('ko-KR')}건`);
        $('[data-ledger-body]').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(r=>`<tr><td>${esc(r.certificate_no)}</td><td>${esc(r.issue_date)}</td><td>${esc(r.dharma_name_ko)}</td><td>${esc(r.monastic_no)}</td><td>${esc(r.temple||'-')}</td><td class="text-left">${esc(r.purpose)}</td><td>${esc(r.signatory_name)}</td><td>${esc(r.status)}</td><td><div class="row-actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" data-print-id="${esc(r.id)}">출력</button>${r.status==='발급'?`<button type="button" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm danger" data-cancel-id="${esc(r.id)}">취소</button>`:''}</div></td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan="9">발급내역이 없습니다.</td></tr>';
        $$('[data-print-id]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',async()=>{const d=await api('/api/monastic-certificates/query',{operation:'detail',id:b.dataset.printId});if(!d.ok){alert(d.message);return;}printRecord(d.row)}));
        $$('[data-cancel-id]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',async()=>{const reason=prompt('발급취소 사유를 입력해 주세요.');if(!reason)return;const d=await api('/api/monastic-certificates/action',{operation:'cancel',id:b.dataset.cancelId,reason});if(!d.ok){alert(d.message);return;}loadLedger()}));
        $('[data-ledger-pagination]').innerHTML=`<button type="button" data-page="${Math.max(1,page-1)}" ${page===1?'disabled':''}>‹</button><button class="active">${page} / ${pages}</button><button type="button" data-page="${Math.min(pages,page+1)}" ${page===pages?'disabled':''}>›</button>`;
        $$('[data-page]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{page=Number(b.dataset.page);loadLedger()}));
      };
      $('[data-ledger-search]').addEventListener('click',()=>{page=1;loadLedger()});
      $('[data-ledger-query]').addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Enter'){page=1;loadLedger()}});
      $$('[data-ledger-status],[data-ledger-size]').forEach(x=>x.addEventListener('change',()=>{page=1;loadLedger()}));
      const csv=()=>{const q=x=>{const t=String(x??''),safe=/^[\t\r\n ]*[=+\-@]/.test(t)?`'${t}`:t;return `"${safe.replace(/"/g,'""')}"`};const data=[['발급번호','발급일','법명','승적번호','소속 사찰','용도','발급명의','상태'],...rows.map(r=>[r.certificate_no,r.issue_date,r.dharma_name_ko,r.monastic_no,r.temple,r.purpose,r.signatory_name,r.status])];const blob=new Blob(['\ufeff'+data.map(x=>x.map(q).join(',')).join('\r\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'});const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=`승적증명서_발급대장_${today()}.csv`;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)};
      $('[data-ledger-export]').addEventListener('click',csv);
      loadOptions();
    })();
  </script>
  <style>
    .certificate-issue-panel{margin-bottom:1rem}.section-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1rem}
    .section-title h2{margin:0;font-size:1.12rem}.section-title p{margin:.2rem 0 0;color:var(--gov-muted);font-size:.8rem}
    .privacy-note{font-size:.76rem;color:#6e520a;background:#fff8e6;border:1px solid #ead49a;padding:.4rem .55rem;border-radius:5px}
    .certificate-form-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.certificate-form-grid .form-field--full{grid-column:1/-1}
    .certificate-person-pick{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1rem;align-items:start;width:100%}
    .certificate-person-pick .form-field{min-width:0}.certificate-person-pick select,.certificate-person-pick input{width:100%;min-width:0}
    .certificate-registry-search{display:flex;gap:.45rem;align-items:center}.certificate-registry-search input{flex:1;min-width:0}.certificate-registry-search button{flex:0 0 auto;white-space:nowrap}
    .certificate-person-pick .field-hint{min-height:1.25em}
    .employment-smart-date{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 40px 46px;position:relative;gap:.35rem;align-items:center;min-width:0}
    .employment-smart-date>input[type=text]{width:100%;min-width:0}.employment-smart-date-picker-shell{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:38px;background:#fff;color:#304b70;border:1px solid var(--gov-border);border-radius:5px;cursor:pointer}
    .employment-smart-date-native{position:absolute!important;right:50px;bottom:0;width:1px!important;height:1px!important;min-height:0!important;opacity:.01;pointer-events:none}
    .employment-smart-date-weekday{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:46px;height:38px;background:#f3f6fa;border:1px solid var(--gov-border);border-radius:5px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:800;color:#304b70}
    .employment-smart-date-weekday[hidden]{visibility:hidden;display:inline-flex!important}
    .certificate-logo-check{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.55rem;min-height:38px;padding:.45rem .65rem;border:1px solid var(--gov-border);border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;font-size:.84rem;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .certificate-logo-check input[type=checkbox]{width:17px;height:17px;min-height:0;margin:0;accent-color:var(--gov-accent)}
    .field-hint{display:block;color:var(--gov-muted);font-size:.72rem;margin-top:.2rem}
    .form-actions{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:.5rem;margin-top:1rem;padding-top:.8rem;border-top:1px solid var(--gov-border)}
    .ledger-filters input{min-width:250px}.row-actions{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:.3rem}.danger{color:#a12626;border-color:#dfb4b4}
    .certificate-preview-modal{width:min(980px,calc(100vw - 2rem))}.certificate-preview-modal [data-preview-container]{overflow:auto;background:#dfe4ea;padding:1rem}
    @media(max-width:1100px){.certificate-form-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:700px){.certificate-form-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.certificate-person-pick{grid-template-columns:1fr}.section-title{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.ledger-filters input{min-width:0;width:100%}}
  </style>
</ManagementLayout>
